# The archives this branch's probes were measured against, in the format `sha256sum` writes and
# reads, so that `sha256sum -c keepass.sha256` checks them too. Measuring another version adds a
# line rather than replacing a line. 2.62 is the KeePass every probe here is built with and loads
# KeePassLib from; its line is the product's own pin at the commit the evaluation was made against.
# 2.61.1 and 2.47 are the releases `spikes/revocation-merge` measured, kept because the evaluation
# re-reads what that branch recorded.
